\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   The Lord is so good;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I often offend
\par I'm nothing so good,
\par and that I'm so rot
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O, Jesus, you know that
\par I can't do nothing;
\par be merciful to me
\par and let me repent,
\par   and serve you always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.  Take sorrows away
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   and let me your peace;
\par   to stay in my heart
\par   and make me humble
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O, Jesus, take all sins
\par   and curses away
\par   come, set me free O Lord,
\par   give me your mercies
\par   and life evermore.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Do not pay me back
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 that I so deserve.
\par Be merciful Lord
\par and forgive my sins.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par That in your precious blood
\par I may righteous be
\par You've paid for all my price
\par my troubles have ceased
\par and I am for you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  And do let me not
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Forget all my pains;
\par do let me remember
\par Your mercies and gifts.
\par Your ever mercifulness
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I deserve not
\par I will praise your name
\par Now and forevermore,
\par \pard      Praise You evermore.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

